      "remarks": [
        "First-line acute stabilising therapy for myasthenic crisis (alongside",
        "plasma exchange, not separately modelled here). RxNorm 42386 already",
        "maps to HCPCS J1599 in rxnorm_hcpcs_map.json -- the same mapping",
        "CIDP.json's IVIG_Therapy state uses."
      ],
      "codes": [
