    "Refractory_MG_Pathway": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "mg_refractory",
      "value": true,
      "remarks": [
        "There is no pre-coordinated SNOMED CT concept for 'Refractory myasthenia gravis'.",
        "Refractoriness is recorded here as an internal Synthea attribute (mg_refractory).",
        "The clinical signal in the generated FHIR record is that the patient already has",
        "an active 91637004 Myasthenia gravis Condition AND receives rituximab via the",
        "Advanced_Treatment state below — i.e. third-line therapy after first- and second-line",
